  "title": "Bacon Wrapped Chicken",
  "description": "Topped with a rich cream sauce, these bacon-wrapped chicken breasts are rolled around a mild, cheesy filling. Perfect with a side of fettuccini.",
  "authors": [
    "Anna Henson"
  ],
  "date_published": "1999-05-16T01:25:48-04:00",
  "date_modified": "2022-08-08T11:36:11-04:00",
